    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a dark force moves through the land\u00a0 Prince Brand Warcford must track it down and attempt to stop it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must follow the evil throughout the world by raft and ship to discover why it is here and what it wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the hero and attempt to save your Kingdom ...or what is left of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the use of ancient weapons, powerful spells and magical equipment to outfit yourself on your journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, bows and sorcery- you'll find plenty of tools to aid you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can take the time to craft their gear or make potions to assist along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Dark is a single player Action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by leveling up and increasing your attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features trade skills: Fishing, Alchemy, Crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless monsters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous Side Quests </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abundance of Treasure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hours of Gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a dark force moves through the land\u00a0 Prince Brand Warcford must track it down and attempt to stop it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must follow the evil throughout the world by raft and ship to discover why it is here and what it wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the hero and attempt to save your Kingdom ...or what is left of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the use of ancient weapons, powerful spells and magical equipment to outfit yourself on your journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs, bows and sorcery- you'll find plenty of tools to aid you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can take the time to craft their gear or make potions to assist along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Dark is a single player Action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by leveling up and increasing your attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features trade skills: Fishing, Alchemy, Crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless monsters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous Side Quests </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abundance of Treasure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hours of Gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
